          "author": "Tender Tales",
          "description": "A girl feels upset when the shirt she wants to wear to a birthday party is dirty. Two friends at school struggle to share markers. A boy becomes frustrated when his mom tells him he can't keep his stuffed animal on the table during dinner. \n\nTender Tales are interactive short stories that focus on realistic, everyday challenges and emotions children encounter.\n\nAs children see themselves in these relatable stories, they learn to build resilience and navigate their world with empathy and kindness.\n\nPair this collection with the companion book from the Creator's website: https://tendertalesstories.com/products/seventh-collection-book\n\nTender Tales are inclusive stories that value all children and families 🏳️‍🌈. Written and narrated by the Creator.",
